  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252ffaq\" rel=\"nofollow\">常见问题</a> | <a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fsleeping_bags%252fcredits\" rel=\"nofollow\">鸣谢</a></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不会重置重生点的睡袋。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZsiwECS.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/f6VfJVX6ioGCNqQekV/giphy.gif\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组还提供配置选项以启用单人睡眠功能，以便在多人服务器中，单人玩家可以跳过夜晚。</span></p>",
